Z||000000||Ken Wittlief||09-13-2001||09:44 AM||||Who has suffered military defeat at the hands of the united states - to Prez Bush senior?<P>Who has lost hundreds of thousands of soldiers to american forces?<P>Whos airspace has been patrolled by the US military for the last 10 years?<P>Whos missle sites are continually bombed by the US?<P>Who would let his own people starve while funding this operation?<P>Who has a personal vendetta against former Prez Bush - and would love to kill his son right in the oval office?<P>Who would be willing to go to the extra length to fund FOUR planes skyjacked - two to destroy the WTC and then TWO more to wait and see where the Prez was - the first learned he was in Florida and diverted their attack to the Pentagon - revenge for the military humiation he suffered at their hands.<P>The fourth was timed to wait till air force one returned to washington, to take it out in the air, or on the runway as it landed.<P>Bin laden may have been a part of the organization - but he has been set up to take the blame - probabally more so than he agreed to. In typical double cross fashon - Bin Laden will be dead in the near future, one way or antoher.<P>Does Sadamm care if afganistan gets nuked? No! He would welcome it!<P>This is not a holy war. Saddamm is not a holy man. He is purely after power and riches. A 'holy war' raging in the middle east would be his greatest diversion, his greatest accomplishment - let the arabs and Israel and the US and China and Russia fight it out, in afganistan and Israel, Jordan and Eqypt, while he waits in the sidelines for the dust to settle.<P>If you want to know who commited a crime - look for the person with the greatest motive - the person with the most to gain.<P>This is why no one has claimed responsibility - this was not terrorism.<P>Revenge - setting up afganistan - stirring up arab religous hatred towards Israel and the US - set a regional war in motion from which he can emerge the leader of Islam.<P>Israel intelligence is already supplying proof that Iraq was behind the whole thing.<P>It was Saddam.<P>||||reg||1
